@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF

title Ch06.11: 비동기 처리 - Redis Pub/Sub 및 DLQ

== 1. Redis Pub/Sub 구조 ==

component "Order Service" as OrderService
component "EventPublisher" as Publisher
queue "Redis Pub/Sub" as Redis {
  channel "order:created"
  channel "payment:completed"
}
component "OrderCreatedEventListener" as OrderListener
component "PaymentCompletedEventListener" as PaymentListener
component "Payment Service" as PaymentService

OrderService --> Publisher : publishOrderCreated()
Publisher --> Redis : PUBLISH order:created
Redis --> OrderListener : SUBSCRIBE order:created
OrderListener --> PaymentService : processPayment()
PaymentService --> Publisher : publishPaymentCompleted()
Publisher --> Redis : PUBLISH payment:completed
Redis --> PaymentListener : SUBSCRIBE payment:completed
PaymentListener --> OrderService : updateOrderStatus()

note right of Redis
    Redis Pub/Sub 특징:
    - Publish → Subscribe 패턴
    - 비동기 통신
    - 여러 구독자 가능
    - 메시지 순서 보장 안 함
end note

== 2. 주문 생성 → 결제 처리 시퀀스 ==

actor "Client" as Client
participant "OrderService" as OrderService
participant "EventPublisher" as Publisher
participant "Redis Pub/Sub" as Redis
participant "OrderCreatedEventListener" as OrderListener
participant "PaymentService" as PaymentService
participant "PaymentCompletedEventListener" as PaymentListener

Client -> OrderService: POST /api/orders
activate OrderService

OrderService -> OrderService: 1. 상품 조회 및 재고 차감
OrderService -> OrderService: 2. 주문 저장 (PENDING)
OrderService -> Publisher: publishOrderCreated(event)
activate Publisher
Publisher -> Redis: PUBLISH order:created
deactivate Publisher
OrderService -> Client: OrderResponse (PENDING)
deactivate OrderService

Redis -> OrderListener: SUBSCRIBE order:created
activate OrderListener
OrderListener -> OrderListener: 이벤트 파싱
OrderListener -> PaymentService: processPayment() (비동기)
activate PaymentService
PaymentService -> PaymentService: 결제 처리
PaymentService -> Publisher: publishPaymentCompleted(event)
activate Publisher
Publisher -> Redis: PUBLISH payment:completed
deactivate Publisher
deactivate PaymentService
deactivate OrderListener

Redis -> PaymentListener: SUBSCRIBE payment:completed
activate PaymentListener
PaymentListener -> PaymentListener: 이벤트 파싱
PaymentListener -> OrderService: updateOrderStatus() (CONFIRMED)
activate OrderService
OrderService -> OrderService: 주문 상태 업데이트
deactivate OrderService
deactivate PaymentListener

note over OrderService, PaymentListener
    비동기 처리:
    - 주문 생성과 결제 처리가 분리
    - 응답 시간 단축
    - 확장성 향상
end note

== 3. DLQ (Dead Letter Queue) 구조 ==

component "Event Listener" as Listener
database "DeadLetterMessage\n(DB)" as DLQ
component "DlqProcessor\n(Scheduler)" as Processor
queue "Redis Pub/Sub" as Redis2

Listener -> Listener: 이벤트 처리 중 예외 발생
Listener -> DLQ: saveToDLQ()\n(채널, 메시지, 에러)
activate DLQ
deactivate DLQ

Processor -> DLQ: findByStatus(PENDING)\n(1분마다)
activate Processor
DLQ -> Processor: PENDING 메시지 목록
Processor -> Processor: retryMessage()\n(재시도)
Processor -> Redis2: 이벤트 재발행
Processor -> DLQ: markAsProcessed()\n또는 incrementRetryCount()
deactivate Processor

note right of DLQ
    DLQ 특징:
    - 처리 실패 메시지 저장
    - 재시도 횟수 관리
    - 최대 3회 재시도
    - 상태: PENDING, PROCESSED, FAILED
end note

== 4. DLQ 재처리 시퀀스 ==

participant "DlqProcessor" as Processor
database "DeadLetterMessage" as DLQ
participant "EventPublisher" as Publisher
queue "Redis Pub/Sub" as Redis3

Processor -> Processor: @Scheduled (1분마다)
activate Processor

Processor -> DLQ: findByStatusAndRetryCountLessThan\n(PENDING, 3)
DLQ -> Processor: PENDING 메시지 목록

loop 각 메시지에 대해
    Processor -> Processor: retryMessage(dlqMessage)
    Processor -> Processor: JSON 파싱
    alt 재처리 성공
        Processor -> Publisher: publishOrderCreated()\n또는 publishPaymentCompleted()
        Publisher -> Redis3: PUBLISH
        Processor -> DLQ: markAsProcessed()
    else 재처리 실패
        Processor -> DLQ: incrementRetryCount()
        alt 최대 재시도 횟수 초과
            Processor -> DLQ: markAsFailed()
        end
    end
    Processor -> DLQ: save(dlqMessage)
end

deactivate Processor

note over Processor, DLQ
    DLQ 재처리:
    - 1분마다 실행
    - 최대 3회 재시도
    - 성공 시 PROCESSED
    - 실패 시 FAILED
end note

== 5. 이벤트 도메인 모델 ==

class OrderCreatedEvent {
    +Long orderId
    +String customerId
    +String productId
    +Integer quantity
    +Long totalPrice
    +String paymentMethod
    +LocalDateTime createdAt
}

class PaymentCompletedEvent {
    +Long paymentId
    +Long orderId
    +Long amount
    +String transactionId
    +String status
    +LocalDateTime completedAt
}

class DeadLetterMessage {
    +Long id
    +String channel
    +String message
    +String errorMessage
    +String stackTrace
    +Integer retryCount
    +MessageStatus status
    +LocalDateTime createdAt
    +LocalDateTime processedAt
}

enum MessageStatus {
    PENDING
    PROCESSED
    FAILED
}

OrderCreatedEvent --> MessageStatus : 없음
PaymentCompletedEvent --> MessageStatus : 없음
DeadLetterMessage --> MessageStatus : status

== 6. 전체 아키텍처 ==

package "Order Service" {
    component "OrderController" as OrderController
    component "OrderService" as OrderService2
    component "EventPublisher" as Publisher2
}

package "Redis Pub/Sub" {
    queue "order:created" as OrderChannel
    queue "payment:completed" as PaymentChannel
}

package "Event Consumers" {
    component "OrderCreatedEventListener" as OrderListener2
    component "PaymentCompletedEventListener" as PaymentListener2
}

package "Payment Service" {
    component "PaymentService" as PaymentService2
    component "EventPublisher" as Publisher3
}

database "Order DB" as OrderDB
database "Payment DB" as PaymentDB
database "DLQ DB" as DLQDB

OrderController --> OrderService2
OrderService2 --> Publisher2
Publisher2 --> OrderChannel
OrderChannel --> OrderListener2
OrderListener2 --> PaymentService2
PaymentService2 --> Publisher3
Publisher3 --> PaymentChannel
PaymentChannel --> PaymentListener2
PaymentListener2 --> OrderService2

OrderService2 --> OrderDB
PaymentService2 --> PaymentDB
OrderListener2 --> DLQDB
PaymentListener2 --> DLQDB

component "DlqProcessor" as Processor2
Processor2 --> DLQDB
Processor2 --> Publisher2
Processor2 --> Publisher3

note right of OrderChannel
    이벤트 기반 아키텍처:
    - 느슨한 결합
    - 비동기 처리
    - 확장성
    - 장애 격리
end note

@enduml
